             105                     MODULE mod_sit_vdiff
             106                     
             107                     ! 1. History
             108                     !
             109                     !     v0.1: July, 1998,  Ben-Jei Tsuang
             110                     !     v0.76g: 18 July 2001, Ben-Jei Tsuang
             111                     !     1) correct the bug of molecular heat diffusivity (1.34E-7 m2/s)
             112                     !     2) new lwaterlevel logic for fixed water level run
             113                     !     3) set heat diffusivity within the surface viscous sublayer to be
             114                     !        the molecular heat diffusivity
             115                     !     v0.76i: 18 July 2001, Ben-Jei Tsuang
             116                     !     1) modify diffusivity of skin layer to be the geometric mean between molecular diff and XK(0)
             117                     !     2) modify radiation parameterization of skin layer of thickness "d"
             118                     !     v0.76j: 18 July 2001, Ben-Jei Tsuang
             119                     !     1) reset the diffusivity of skin layer to be XK(0)
             120                     !     v0.76k: 18 July 2001, Ben-Jei Tsuang
             121                     !     1) set radiation param. to be dFFN
             122                     !     v0.76l: 18 July 2001, Ben-Jei Tsuang
             123                     !     1) reset radiation param. to be the thickness of effective thickness
             124                     !     v0.76i: 18 July 2001, Ben-Jei Tsuang
             125                     !     1) reset radiation param and skin layer diff to be that in v.76i
             126                     !     v0.76m: 24 July 2001, Ben-Jei Tsuang
             127                     !     1) modify DTDZ to DRHODZ for stabiliy criterion
             128                     !     v0.76n: 25 July 2001, Chia-Ying Tu
             129                     !     1) ambient diffusion coefficeint is added
             130                     !     v0.76o: 25 July 2001, Chia-Ying Tu
             131                     !     1) minimum 0.3 m of mixing length is chosen
             132                     !     v0.77: 1 Aug 2001,
             133                     !     1) calibrate Prandtl number
             134                     !     v0.78: emin, EResRatio
             135                     !     v0.90: 9 Jan 2003, Chia-Ying Tu
             136                     !     1) add mo_thmcln
             137                     !     2) xkmmin xkhmin hcoolskin hcoolskin emin are set from arguments
             138                     !     3) use Inverse Problem to determine above values
             139                     !     v1.00: 29 July 2007, Ben-Jei Tsuang
             140                     !     1) port to ECHMA-5.4.00
             141                     !     2) modify heice and hesn
             142                     !     v1.30: 1 September 2008, Ben-Jei Tsuang
             143                     !     1) Modify Water Level Logical for lsoil
             144                     !     v3.2: 26 August 2008, Ben-Jei Tsuang
             145                     !     1) modify coordinate system according to Tsuang et al. (2009)
             146                     !        "A more accurate scheme for calcualting Earth's skin temperature",
             147                     !        Climate Dynamics
             148                     !     v5.0: June 2009, Ben-Jei Tsuang
             149                     !     1) Add below ice surface heat/fresh water fluxes for coupling with embedded ocean model
             150                     !     2) Add sufsurface (at about 10-20 m depth) heat/salinity fluxes for coupling with embedded ocean model
             151                     !     3) Turn on the ice module with security number for coupling with embedded ocean model
             152                     !     v5.1: June 2009, Ben-Jei Tsuang
             153                     !     1) A semi-implicity scheme for snow/ice temperature (TSI) coupling with vdiff (atmosphere)
             154                     !     v5.3: July 2009, Ben-Jei Tsuang
             155                     !     1) A new density function of pressure, temperature and salinity is needed for
             156                     !        vertical diffusion calculation
             157                     !     2) Bug fixed for density function
             158                     !     v7.7: snow/ice temperate set to be the underneach temp if these layers are missing. (bjt,2010/5)
             159                     !     v7.9 (bjt, 2010/5/29)
             160                     !     1) sit_vdiff.f90: seaice mask: Winner wins!
             161                     !     v8.7 (bjt, 2011/8/29)
             162                     !      Assunimg no skin layer for momentm since wind shear can enforce on the side. Note that the surface heat flux is from the top. (2011/8/29 bjt)
             163                     !     v9.8b          zcor=MAX(ABS(pcoriol(jl)),zepcor)  ! v9.8b: 20130822  (restore the corlios security number)
             164                     !     v9.86: bug correction: initialize pwtke
             165                     !     v9.84 (Same as v9.83 + xlkmin=0.) (bjt, 2013/9/10)
             166                     !     v9.85: salti  (seaice is salty at salti PSU) (bjt, 2013/9/11)
             167                     !     v9.86: emin  (truncate tke to 0, for tke < emin, 10-6 ms/s2) (bjt, 2013/9/13)
             168                     !     v9.862: rhom(jk)=rho_from_theta(wsm(jk),wtm(jk)-tmelt,0.) (bjt, 2013/9/15), change to potential water density
             169                     !     v9.864: CALL nudging_sit_viff_gd(jl,jrow,six_hour,six_hour,six_hour,six_hour,six_hour,.TRUE.) (bjt, 2013/9/16), nudging within 10 m depth as well
             170                     !     v9.865: v9.864+no truncate low tke+no contrain in huge tke, emin=1.0E-6 (bjt, 2013/9/18)
             171                     !     v9.866: emin=1.0E-4 !limit min pwtke to 1.0E-4 (v9.866)
             172                     !     v9.867: emin=1.0E-5 !limit min pwtke to 1.0E-5 (v9.867)
             173                     !     v9.868: emin=1.0E-4 !limit min pwtke to 1.0E-4 (v9.868)
             174                     !     v9.869: CALL nudging_sit_viff_gd(jl,jrow,six_hour,six_hour,one_month,six_hour,six_hour,.TRUE.) (bjt, 2013/9/16), nudging > 100 m depth at 1-month time scale
             175                     !     v9.871: Add d0 for reaching the bottom d0=0.03  ! zero-displacement (m) (0.02,0.05)
             176                     !     v9.873: emin=1.0E-5 !limit min pwtke to 1.0E-5 (v9.873)
             177                     !     v9.874: change drho/dz from potentail density at surface to the potential density diff at the level (v9.874)
             178                     !             real,PARAMETER::emin=1.0E-4 !limit min pwtke to 1.0E-4 (v9.866),(v9.874)
             179                     !     v9.880: 1) bug found for ! bug, v0.9879
             180                     ! &             -0.5_dp*ce*zdtime*wtkem(level)**(1.5_dp)/pwldisp(jl,level)                   &   ! bug, v0.9879
             181                     !             2) emin=1.0E-5 !limit min pwtke to 1.0E-5 (v9.873)
             182                     !     v9.884: bug correction for RHOE
             183                     !     v9.886: 1)bug correction for pwkm=ck*lk*e^0.5, then pwkh=pwkm/Pr
             184                     !             2) introducing steady TKE
             185                     !     v9.892: 1) with prho1000 output
             186                     !     v9.893: 1) nudging for deep salinity for coupled model during spinup period
             187                     !     v9.8999:
             188                     !     v10.4:  1) partial open water and partial ice sheet are revised by changing
             189                     !                0.5*hsn to 0.5*hsn/seaice
             190                     !                0.5*hice to 0.5*hice/seaice
             191                     !     v10.601:  1) module sit_vdiff
             192                     !                2) steady-TKE
             193                     !     v10.602:  1) friction is added in one-column model (fr=7.E-5/s)
             194                     !                2) unsteady-TKE
             195                     !
             196                     ! 11. REFERENCE
             197                     !     Gaspar, P., Y. Gregoris, and J.-M. Lefevre,1990: A simple eddy
             198                     !         kinetic energy model for simulation of the oceanic vertical
             199                     !         mixing: test at station Papa and long-term upper ocean study
             200                     !         site. JGR, 95, 16179-16193.
             201                     !     Tu, C.-Y.; Tsuang, B.-J., 2005/11: Cool-skin simulation by a one-column
             202                     !         ocean model, Geophys. Res. Lett., 32, L22602, doi:10.1029/2005GL024252.
             203                     !     Tsuang, B.-J., C.-Y. Tu, J.-L. Tsai, J.A. Dracup, K. Arpe and T. Meyers, 2009:
             204                     !         A more accurate scheme for calculating Earth's skin temperature.
             205                     !         Climate Dynamics, DOI 10.1007/s00382-008-0479-2, on-line version available.
             206                     !
             207                     ! 12. Bug known
             208                     !     Coriols force needed to be corrected for considering the curvature of the Earth
